Brainstorming means generating and discussing ideas for the project before development.

Project Idea: ComicCraft is an AI-powered application that helps users create comic stories using Google Gemini AI. Users can provide a simple story idea or prompt, and the system uses Gemini to generate characters, dialogues, scenes, and a complete comic-style story.

In simple words:

User Idea → Gemini AI → Story → Characters + Dialogues + Scenes → Comic
